Spec: .NET server authorization library

Purpose:
  Bind authenticated server snapshots and signed leases to exact application/service authority.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Authority.csproj
  ./packages.lock.json

References:
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Control/LinkGate.Control.sdd

Must:
  Pin dependency versions and keep borrowed device-key handles inside platform mTLS; never export private key material or accept business-service dial targets.
